OL,3,GNEWSAInside the crackdown on illegal
OL,4,Avapes and illicit tobacco
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice forces and councils across
OL,7,Fnorth-west England have shut vape shops
OL,8,Fand seized thousands of illegal items
OL,9,Fin the last year, new figures show.
OL,11,FBBC analysis found more than 30
OL,12,Fpremises have been closed over their
OL,13,Flinks to illegal vapes and illicit
OL,14,Ftobacco.
OL,16,FThe findings come after the Prime
OL,17,FMinister announced plans to give
OL,18,Fcouncils greater powers to tackle rogue
OL,19,Fretailers and extend closure orders.
